version: 1.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-23"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/gevaertlab/chexboard-cxr-leaderboard
url: https://gevaertlab.github.io/chexboard-cxr-leaderboard/
abstract: >-
  An interactive static leaderboard for a benchmark of 10 chest X-ray artificial
  intelligence models across 12 multinational cohorts (7 public, 5 private).
  Results can be filtered by model, region, cohort, finding, task category and
  age band, and read as a ranked table or as ranking, heatmap, model-versus-model
  and per-category charts. Every number is the equal-weight-per-finding
  aggregation reported in the accompanying article. Each cohort-finding value
  carries a percentile bootstrap 95% confidence interval; aggregate intervals are
  the mean ± 1.96 standard errors across findings.
keywords:
  - chest X-ray
  - medical imaging
  - benchmarking
  - external validation
  - foundation models
  - leaderboard
